{
  "esm": "2.4.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_flux_x",
    "description": "The zonal PPM layer-flux lowering rule of the mom6_cgrid: matches the user rewrite target mom6_cgrid_flux_x(h, u_E, dy_Cu_E, mask, h_min_recon, dt, IdxT, IdxT_e) (the east-face layer volume flux of every cell) and emits the [i,j,k] makearray of the MOM6 zonal flux law (zonal_flux_layer, MOM_continuity_PPM.F90:950-966, VOL_CFL=False, por_face_areaU = 1): uh(i,j,k) = dy_Cu_E(i,j) * u_E(i,j,k) * (the PPM parabola integral of the UPWIND cell's PPM_limit_pos-limited edges). The sign of the face velocity selects the upwind cell, and the two branches apply the one per-cell reconstruction to two one-cell-shifted stencils: u_E > 0 upwinds the cell itself, mom6_ppm_upwind_flux_pos bound to the stencil i-2..i+2 with I_dx = IdxT(i,j) (F90:952-957: CFL = u*dt*IdxT(i,j), uh = dy*u*(h_E(i) + CFL*(0.5*(h_W(i) - h_E(i)) + curv_3*(CFL - 1.5)))); u_E < 0 upwinds the east neighbour, mom6_ppm_upwind_flux_neg bound to the stencil i-1..i+3 with I_dx = IdxT_e(i,j) (F90:958-964: CFL = -u*dt*IdxT(i+1,j), uh = dy*u*(h_W(i+1) + CFL*(0.5*(h_E(i+1) - h_W(i+1)) + curv_3*(CFL - 1.5)))); u_E == 0 gives the zero flux. The reconstruction (center slopes, raw edges, PPM_limit_pos scale, limited edges, parabola integral) lives in the stencil laws, so the meridional rule mom6_cgrid_flux_y applies the same two templates along j. LAND CLOSURE: the stencil index expressions CLAMP at the domain edges (max(1, i-2), max(1, i-1) low; min(N_I, i+2), min(N_I, i+3) high), and the clamp reproduces MOM6's land-masked closure exactly, as if the cells outside the domain were land (mask2dT = 0): a clamped thickness equals the masked-neighbour replacement h_im1 = h(i) of PPM_reconstruction_x (F90:2430-2431), and the clamped center slope of an edge cell and of a ghost cell is identically zero (the Lin bound 2*min(dMx, dMn) vanishes when two of the three stencil values coincide), which is the masked zero slope of F90:2397-2398. The faces next to the walls (i = 1, i = N_I-1) are therefore the MOM6 faces of a basin closed by land, pinned numerically by problems/mom6_cgrid_flux_ppm.esm. The EAST DOMAIN WALL is an explicit region: the face at i = N_I (the east edge of the last cell column, between the last ocean cell and the land beyond) carries the zero flux of a solid wall whatever u_E holds there (MOM6 sets u = 0 on a land face); the convergence (uh(i,j) - uh(i-1,j))*IareaT then telescopes to -uh(N_I-1)*IareaT in the sibling mom6_cgrid_div_x. The consuming model spells uh = mom6_cgrid_flux_x(h, u_E, dy_Cu_E, mask, h_min_recon, dt, IdxT, IdxT_e) with h [i,j,k], u_E [i,j,k], the horizontal metrics dy_Cu_E/IdxT/IdxT_e [i,j], mask [i,j] and the scalars h_min_recon/dt (esm-spec 9.6.1: non-param strings in the match are literal per-variable selectors, so the rule fires only on THIS operator with exactly these argument variables).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:rule", "family:mom6_cgrid", "grid:mom6_cgrid", "op:advection", "order:3", "bc:wall", "axes:i,j,k", "spec:9.6.8"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Colella, P., & Woodward, P. R. (1984). The Piecewise Parabolic Method (PPM) for gas-dynamical simulations. Journal of Computational Physics, 54(1), 174-201.",
        "doi": "10.1016/0021-9991(84)90143-8"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Lin, S.-J. (1994). A nearly conservative flux-reconstruction scheme. Monthly Weather Review, 122(5), 994-1011. (The monotonic slope constraint, Eq. B2.)"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      }
    ]
  },
  "operator_imports": [
    { "ref": "../grid.esm" },
    { "ref": "../stencils/mom6_ppm_upwind_flux_pos.esm" },
    { "ref": "../stencils/mom6_ppm_upwind_flux_neg.esm" }
  ],
  "operators": {
    "mom6_cgrid_flux_x": {
      "params": ["h", "u_E", "dy_Cu_E", "mask", "h_min_recon", "dt", "IdxT", "IdxT_e"],
      "priority": 10,
      "match": { "op": "mom6_cgrid_flux_x", "args": ["h", "u_E", "dy_Cu_E", "mask", "h_min_recon", "dt", "IdxT", "IdxT_e"] },
      "where": {
        "h": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "u_E": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "dy_Cu_E": { "shape": ["i", "j"] },
        "mask": { "shape": ["i", "j"] },
        "IdxT": { "shape": ["i", "j"] },
        "IdxT_e": { "shape": ["i", "j"] }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [[1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], [1, "N_J"], [1, "N_K"]],
          [["N_I", "N_I"], [1, "N_J"], [1, "N_K"]]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["h", "u_E", "dy_Cu_E", "mask", "h_min_recon", "dt", "IdxT", "IdxT_e"],
            "ranges": { "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }], "j": [1, "N_J"], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "ifelse",
              "args": [
                { "op": ">", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["u_E", "i", "j", "k"] }, 0.0] },
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_ppm_upwind_flux_pos",
                  "bindings": {
                    "u": { "op": "index", "args": ["u_E", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "dt": "dt",
                    "dy": { "op": "index", "args": ["dy_Cu_E", "i", "j"] },
                    "I_dx": { "op": "index", "args": ["IdxT", "i", "j"] },
                    "h_m2": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                    "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                    "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                    "h_p2": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                    "m_m2": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j"] },
                    "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                    "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                    "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] },
                    "m_p2": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j"] },
                    "h_min_recon": "h_min_recon"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "op": "ifelse",
                  "args": [
                    { "op": "<", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["u_E", "i", "j", "k"] }, 0.0] },
                    {
                      "op": "apply_operator",
                      "args": [],
                      "name": "mom6_ppm_upwind_flux_neg",
                      "bindings": {
                        "u": { "op": "index", "args": ["u_E", "i", "j", "k"] },
                        "dt": "dt",
                        "dy": { "op": "index", "args": ["dy_Cu_E", "i", "j"] },
                        "I_dx": { "op": "index", "args": ["IdxT_e", "i", "j"] },
                        "h_m2": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                        "h_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", "i", "j", "k"] },
                        "h_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                        "h_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                        "h_p2": { "op": "index", "args": ["h", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 3] }] }, "j", "k"] },
                        "m_m2": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "max", "args": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }] }, "j"] },
                        "m_m1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", "i", "j"] },
                        "m_0": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"] },
                        "m_p1": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 2] }] }, "j"] },
                        "m_p2": { "op": "index", "args": ["mask", { "op": "min", "args": ["N_I", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 3] }] }, "j"] },
                        "h_min_recon": "h_min_recon"
                      }
                    },
                    0.0
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          0.0
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
